WEBVTT

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.576
and now it is August,

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.216
so I'm guessing that some of you
are probably wondering,

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.616
are we still together?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.015
And the reason I think
you might be wondering this

00:02:10.039 --> 00:02:12.696
is because I have been asked this question

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.656
again and again and again
for the past seven months.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:20.376
And this question is really
what I want to talk about today.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.856
But let's come back to it.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.856
(Laughter)

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.856
So the week before the article came out,

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.576
I was very nervous.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.176
I had been working
on a book about love stories